sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin
    participant PermissionService as Permission Service
    participant ValidateService as Validate Service
    participant System
    participant Database
    participant CacheService as Cache Service

    Note over Admin: Admin Create/Update Flow
    
    Admin->>System: Mutation a Create/Update
    
    System->>PermissionService: Is Admin Logged in?
    
    alt Admin not logged in
        PermissionService-->>System: no
        System->>Admin: Notify error then redirect to login page
        Note over Admin: End
    else Admin logged in
        PermissionService-->>System: yes
        System->>ValidateService: Is data valid?
        
        alt Data invalid
            ValidateService-->>System: no
            System->>Admin: Notify error data
            Note over System,Admin: Merge point
        else Data valid
            ValidateService-->>System: yes
            System->>System: Mutation Update/Create
            System->>Database: INSERT / UPDATE
            Database-->>System: Success
            
            System->>CacheService: Clear Cache
            CacheService-->>System: Cache cleared
            
            System->>System: Data
            Note over System,Admin: Merge point
        end
        
        System->>Admin: Notify Update/Create Success
        
        Admin->>System: Request New Data
        
        rect rgb(200, 255, 200)
            Note over System,CacheService: Query Cache Sub-process
            System->>System: Query Data
            
            System->>CacheService: Cache Hit?
            
            alt Cache Hit
                CacheService-->>System: yes
                CacheService-->>System: Return cached data
                System->>System: Data
            else Cache Miss
                CacheService-->>System: no
                System->>Database: Query data
                Database-->>System: Data
                System->>CacheService: Cache set
                CacheService-->>System: Cache set success
                System->>System: Data
            end
        end
        
        System->>Admin: Display for Admin
        Note over Admin: End
    end
